Subject: [PATCH 5/9] schedhorizon: serialize and bound dynamic tunable tables

New reconstruction from published rc1 and the recorded rc2/rc3 description.
Allocate and parse outside the private table lock. Replace tables
atomically, copy bounded sysfs snapshots, and bound both table indices.

---
